INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`, `Emote1`, `Emote2`, `Emote3`, `Emote4`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `EmoteDelay4`, `RewardText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'We have dealt a blow to the Old Horde and delayed their progress. I have been ordered to pay you in gold for your duties. If you see more of our enemy, make sure to kill them.', 0),
(40257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Blackrock Slayers were a truly terrifying foe, you have done good work.', 0),
(40459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hmm, so you\'re the real deal huh, no way you\'re working with Shadowforge anyway.$B$BYou never can be certain, they have an alignment with the Twilight Hammer afterall.', 0),
(40460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Does it all make sense now? Orvak Sternrock has a vengeance, one that needs to be unleashed.', 0),
(40461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'With this our future is secure, but I will not leave until I taste the sweet sensation of revenge.$B$BI will let the others know that you are to be trusted, speak with them, they should have tasks for you.', 0),
(40462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It feels good knowing that there are less of those scum on this world, but there is still more to be done.', 0),
(40463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Also, take this key, I do not intend to return to the mountain. It should open a chest within the Black Vault, if they haven\'t already taken it away.', 0),
(40464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Orvak would let out a small chuckle of enjoyment.>$B$BThe hatred instilled deep within me has begun to cool, the fire that once raged on has eased.$B$BIt fills me with vigor to know they met their end.$B$BI know deepdown that Shadowforge can never be saved, regardless, I thank you.$B$BI will not be needing this any longer, for I do not intend to return, perhaps you may find some use for it.', 0),
(40465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Radgan would take his time inspecting the cores.>$B$BFlaws, cracks, hmm.. These are some second rate power cores, not the type of stuff I am looking for.', 0),
(40466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hey look, it means a lot for you to travel all that distance for me, I made it worth your while in coin, now lets see...', 0),
(40467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Look at the sheer power within this thing, it is much more advanced than what we used to work on in the Mold Foundry, this is intense.$B$BYou\'ve done me a great favor, and now perhaps I may actually have something to work on when we get out of here.$B$BI reconfigured one of the Golem Cores you got me from the War Reavers, hopefully you\'ll get some use from it!', 0),
(40468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have done well by me, and truly made them bleed. Justice has been served, and their work has been slowed tremendously. I would like to offer you a reward for all of your hard work, take it, as a herald of justice, you deserve it.', 0),
(40469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It is about time Vilegrip got what was coming to him, even if he deserved torture. I prepared a reward for you incase you returned, and here you are, take it.', 0),
(40486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hmm, so there is something going on up there.$B$BHold on just a minute, I got to write a report of my findings and send it to the highest authority.', 0),
(40487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What brings you to Ironforge, how can you assist the Bronzebeard?', 0),
(40488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, how did things go in the capital?', 0),
(40489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<King Magni Bronzebeard would nod his head stoutly.>$B$BThe defence of the kingdom requires us to be steadfast in all manners, I have no doubt you have really shaken things up for our enemy, and put a stop to their plans.$B$BOn behalf of my people I reward you with an item from our armory, may it serve you well.', 0),
(40490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ahh, would you look at all this huh?!$B$BThose crafty bastards sure were keeping their secrets, I\'ll make sure to send this back to Ironforge when I get the chance, and they can look everything over, nice job eh?$B$BI got some extra Thunder Ale for you, oh and me ol\' gloves, they should treat you nicely, I got a new pair.', 0),
(40491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'That\'s quite a haul, I\'m impressed. Joining this new horde might not be so bad after all. You\'ve scavenged so much I even have surplus to forge you an equipment of your choice. I believe you will wear it well.', 0),
(40492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'These shall do nicely, now. Let us see what power they truly hold.', 0),
(40493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This heart belonged to a powerful Felguard, one that desired to serve its masters tirelessly.$B$B<Darkseer Geshtol would examine it carefully.>$B$BIt would appear there are no large flaws, this should work nicely. You\'ve done well out there and have done well for us, I have gathered something you might find useful for all of the hard work.$B$BNow... Lets see what this is capable of...', 0),
(40494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The stench of ogre blood bathes you $C. You might not be useless after all.', 0),
(40495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The arrogant fool lays dead. Ah to be alive $R. I tell you, hearing the demise of those you hate while you\'re still well enough to eat, drink and kill feels like the embrace of a cold and grim fate. But we hold it into our arms with pride and we would never let go. Such is life living under the Horde\'s name, we greet death with open arms and weapons ready.', 0),
(40496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Good. I feel better now. Yet, there is still much to do.', 0),
(40497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This one will do. I will get to training them as soon I can.', 0),
(40498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I knew you had it. You severely weakened the Blackrock Clan with your feat. Without the alpha, it will take years to rebuild their worg population.$B$BSoon, I will once again ride to battle. Thank you, $C. Take this, a gift from myself.', 0),
(40499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It seems you endured their stings and lived to tell the tale. Many lives will be saved thanks to your work. Please accept what little I have as payment.', 0),
(40500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, you\'ve done as I asked. Let\'s see what\'s in those documents.$B$B<Molk takes the documents from you, and stares intently for a few seconds.>$B$BWell, this will surely put a hamper on their plans, the information here must have taken them a while to acquire, and without it they have no leads.$B$BYou are more useful then you look, whelpling.$B$BTake this gold, as a thank you from myself.', 0),
(40501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'How can I help you $R?$B$B<Thrall takes the missive, reading it over.>$B$BKarfang, this name is not familiar to me.', 0),
(40502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hmm, Karfang you say?', 0),
(40503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Karfang looks out at the Warchief\'s Response, beginning to read with caution.>$B$BSo it appears the Warchief is asking us for a test of loyalty, he shall receive his demands.', 0),
(40504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'On behalf of everyone here, you have done us a great service in securing our future, entrance within the Horde means we may get out of this ashen wasteland eventually.$B$BI have seen much in my time on Outland, and in the Blackrock Mountain, but I look forward in what is to come, and for that you have my gratitude.', 0),
(40505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The runts of our group will now be invisible to the Blackrock Clan, vanished from thin air with no trace of where they have gone.$B$BThere is still work to do.', 0),
(40506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You will need to be prepared for what is to come outsider.', 0),
(40507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Picked through the bones have you?$B$B<Karfang lets out a small laugh.>$B$BThis would be what we were looking for, an excellent job outsider, Molk was expecting shoddy work from one of your kin, but you did well.', 0),
(40508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<A deep and heavy sigh escapes Karfang, his face full of emotion.>$B$BI was always impressed with this sword and the way in which he wielded it, he fought with tenacity, and strength, he shall be remembered for it.', 0),
(40509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Karfang\'s old features begin to crack a smile.>$B$BI cannot express my thanks, for this, and everything done.$B$B<Karfang would remove a ring from his finger.>$B$BThis ring was taken upon my entrance to this world, from some noble human lord in battle.$B$BThis keepsake is now yours, thank you.', 0),
(40538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So they were not real whelps? But constructs made of metal by someone that bothered to put their name on each and every one of them? Convenient for us, we now know who to kill.', 0),
(40539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Dark Irons have a new quarry? What were they even digging? Not that it matters since you\'ve put an end to it, I must however report to Karfang.$B$BI\'ve managed to collect a few things from the willing clan members that\'d see you rewarded for your efforts, but you can only pick one. Such is the way of the Blackrock Clan.', 0),
(41969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Such a marvelous material, so bright, and colorful! This will do wonders for the coming ceremonies, and will certainly be better than the last raiment.$B$BThank you $C, and please, take this as a reward.', 0);
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40256, 0, 0, 'Have you done as I asked?', 0),
(40257, 0, 0, 'Have they been eliminated?', 0),
(40459, 0, 0, 'What is it you want $R?', 0),
(40460, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40461, 0, 0, 'Have you recovered my lost items?', 0),
(40462, 0, 0, 'We are on the road to justice, can you can feel it?', 0),
(40463, 0, 0, 'Have you culled that wretch from this world yet?', 0),
(40464, 0, 0, 'Has the deed been done, has the senate been removed?', 0),
(40465, 0, 0, 'Any luck in obtaining those Golem Cores?', 0),
(40466, 0, 0, 'Have you spoken with Jabbey?', 0),
(40467, 0, 0, 'Have you ventured deep into the Blackrock Depths?', 0),
(40468, 0, 0, 'Justice grows ever closer, you can practically feel it.', 0),
(40469, 0, 0, 'Has that worm been trampled $C?', 0),
(40486, 0, 0, 'So, have you ventured up the ridge?', 0),
(40487, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40488, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40489, 0, 0, 'Is there anything I can help you with?', 0),
(40490, 0, 0, 'You get a whiff of what\'s goin on in there yet?', 0),
(40491, 0, 0, 'Hard times call for desperate measures, knowing how to make do with what you have draws the line between life and death.', 0),
(40492, 0, 0, 'The Blood Fury burns within us, and needs to be strengthened.', 0),
(40493, 0, 0, 'I will not wait forever, have you done as I asked whelp?', 0),
(40494, 0, 0, 'Hmph. Pathetic fool.', 0),
(40495, 0, 0, 'Hmph, War Master.', 0),
(40496, 0, 0, 'Have you exacted revenge in my name?', 0),
(40497, 0, 0, 'I have trained many worgs in my life. My first one, years ago, on Draenor...', 0),
(40498, 0, 0, 'Revenge is close.', 0),
(40499, 0, 0, 'Can never be too prepared in these hostile lands.', 0),
(40500, 0, 0, 'I don\'t have time to chat when there are things to be done, so get moving.', 0),
(40501, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40502, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40503, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40504, 0, 0, 'Has it been done?', 0),
(40505, 0, 0, 'Have you destroyed the documents $R?', 0),
(40506, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40507, 0, 0, 'If I were you I would suggest bringing backup.', 0),
(40508, 0, 0, 'We do what we must.', 0),
(40509, 0, 0, 'Have you braved the Blackrock Mountain?', 0),
(40538, 0, 0, 'What have you found out?', 0),
(40539, 0, 0, 'Did you end him?', 0),
(41969, 0, 0, 'Has the fur been procured?', 0);
